Clumps for Sunrise 26.3 (version 0.5.0)

A port of Clumps (26.3) by Jaredlll08.
Original source: https://github.com/jaredlll08/Clumps
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Sunrise by arismoko: the experience orb merging and pickup cooldown rules are
implemented in Rust on Sunrise's typed mod API (no Java code is included).
The mod icon (`icon.png`) is carried from the original repository under the MIT licence.
This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (MIT); the licence text
is in LICENSE.
